- The description can contain Chinese characters, letters, digits, spaces, and special characters. Line breaks are supported.', example='testDescription', minLength=2, maxLength=256, position='Body'),
  imageId?: string(name='ImageId', description='The ID of the cloud computer image. You can query the ID on the Image Management page. System images and custom images are supported.', example='m-gx2x1dhsmusr2****', position='Body'),
  period?: int32(name='Period', description='The subscription duration of the subscription cloud computer. This parameter takes effect and is required only when `ChargeType` is set to `PrePaid`. The unit is specified by `PeriodUnit`.
